    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d24">

                <pb facs="0137" n="21" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg21"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 835.001/35a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the Vice President of
                        Argentina.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 10, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It is with deep regret that I learn of the death of His Excellency President
                    Saenz Pena and I hasten to express to the Government and people of Argentina the
                    sincere sympathy of the Government and people of the United States of America
                    and my own in this great loss sustained by your country.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
